   first-sighting-arms-without-submitting, same-text-second-poll-submits-once,
   empty-composer-resets, submit_enter reports tmux truthfully.

 No false-fire path found; one residual (by design): a human who composes text in a
 worker pane and stops typing for 2 full polls gets one Enter + a page to pane 1 —
 that's the feature, and it's announced.

